hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1220","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi Musalman aadmi Musalman aadmi ko aazad kare Allah us ke har u'zw se us ka u'zw aag se bachaega. Muttafaq alaih; aur Tirmidhi ke han aur unhon ne ise sahih kaha, Abu Umamah se hai: Aur jo bhi Musalman aadmi do Musalman aurton ko aazad kare woh donon us ki aag se aazadi hongi. Aur Abu Dawud ke han Ka'b bin Murrah ki hadees se hai: Aur jo bhi aurat Musalman aurat ko aazad kare woh us ki aag se aazadi hogi."
"1221","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kaun sa amal afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Allah par iman aur Us ke raste mein jihad. Main ne kaha: Phir kaun si gardan afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis ki qeemat sab se buland ho aur apne walon ke han sab se nafees ho. Muttafaq alaih."
"1222","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulam mein apna hissa aazad kare aur us ke paas maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat ko pahunche to insaf ki qeemat lagayi jae; phir apne shareekon ko un ke hisse de, aur ghulam us par aazad ho jaega; warna us mein se jitna aazad hua hai aazad ho gaya. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ke han Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai: Warna us par qeemat lagayi jaegi aur us se baghair mashaqqat ke kamai karai jaegi. Aur kaha gaya ke sa'ayat idraj hai."
"1223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beta walid ka badla nahin de sakta siwae is ke ke use ghulam pae aur aazad kare. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mehram rishtedar ka malik ho woh aazad hai. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur huffaz ki ek jama'at ne tarjeeh di ke yeh mauqoof hai."
"1225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apne marne ke waqt apne chhe ghulam aazad kiye jabke us ke paas un ke siwa maal na tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen bulaya aur unhen teen hisson mein taqseem kiya, phir un ke darmiyan qura dala; to do ko aazad kiya aur chaar ko ghulam rakha; aur un se sakht baat kahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1226","[AI-translation] Hazrat Safinah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main Umm Salamah ka ghulam tha to unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen aazad karti hun aur tum par shart lagati hun ke tum jab tak zinda ho Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat karo. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud, Nasai aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"1227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wala usi ke liye hai jo aazad kare. Muttafaq alaih ek taweel hadees mein."
"1228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wala nasab ke gosht jaisa gosht hai; na becha jata hai na hadiya kiya jata hai. Ise Shafi'i ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ki asl Sahihain mein is lafz ke baghair hai."
"1229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ansar mein se ek aadmi ne apna ghulam apne marne ke baad aazad kiya jabke us ke paas us ke siwa maal na tha. To yeh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko pahunchi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kaun use mujh se khareedta hai? To use Nu'aim bin Abdullah ne aath sau dirham mein khareeda. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke ek lafz mein hai ke woh mohtaj ho gaya; aur Nasai ki ek riwayat mein hai ke us par qarz tha, to use aath sau dirham mein becha aur use diya aur farmaya: Apna qarz ada karo."
"1230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Mukatab ghulam hai jab tak us ki kitabat mein se dirham baqi ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se nikala; aur is ki asl Ahmad aur Salasa ke han hai; aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi aurat ka mukatab ho aur us ke paas ada karne ko ho to woh us se parda kare. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"1232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mukatab ki diyat us se di jaegi jitna us mein se aazad hua hai aazad ki diyat, aur jitna us mein se ghulam raha hai ghulam ki diyat. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"1233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Haris jo Umm al-Mu'minin Juwairiyah ke bhai hain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni wafat ke waqt dirham, dinar, ghulam, bandi ya kuch na chhoda, siwae apni safed khachchar, hathyar aur zameen ke jise Aap ne sadqa banaya tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi bandi apne sardar se bacha jane woh us ki wafat ke baad aazad hai. Ise Ibn Majah aur Hakim ne za'if sanad se nikala; aur ek jama'at ne tarjeeh di ke yeh Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) par mauqoof hai."
"1235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Hunaif (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah ke raste mein mujahid ki madad kare, ya apni tangdasti mein qarz-dar ki, ya apni gardan mein mukatab ki, to Allah use us din saya dega jis din Us ke sae ke siwa koi saya na hoga. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
